    "text": "A gas expands adiabatically at constant pressure such that<br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/>The value of  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi></math> , i.e.,  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>  of the gas will be"
